@startuml Anwendungskontext
left to right direction

actor "Forschender" as Researcher

rectangle "AM-Modell / NLP-Pipeline" as Pipeline

rectangle "DARIUS-Korpus" as Darius
rectangle "OHI-Text" as OHI
rectangle "Evaluierungsumgebung" as EvalUI

Researcher --> Pipeline : trainiert /\nkonfiguriert

Darius --> Pipeline : Trainingsdaten

OHI --> Pipeline : zu analysierender Text

Pipeline --> EvalUI : erkannte\nTAP-Elemente

@enduml